{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Tate 扭"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Tate扭"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>Tate 扭是一个指定的"},{"Local":{"url":"可逆对象","text":"可逆对象"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为 $\\mathbb G_m$ 的平展基本群</h3>\n<p>考虑单位根群\n$$\r\n\\mu_{\\ell^n} := \\operatorname{ker}(x\\mapsto x^{\\ell^n}\\colon \\mathbb G_m \\to \\mathbb G_m),\r\n$$\n以及映射 $\\mu_{\\ell^{n+1}} \\to \\mu_{\\ell^{n}}$, $\\zeta\\mapsto\\zeta^\\ell$.\n定义\n$$\r\n\\mathbb{Z}_\\ell (1) := \\operatorname{lim}_n \\mu_{\\ell^n}.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>作为 $\\mathbb G_m$ 的上同调</h3>\n"}]}}